WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:08.250
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:14.760
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.590
It's my day!

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.170
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:34.580
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.950
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:49.360
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:55.130
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:02.270
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:09.780
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:15.920
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:18.990
I just want to walk

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.530
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.500
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:35.400
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:41.840
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.110
It's my day!

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.600
Just because Domyoji's fianc馥
has shown up...

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:14.440
Why should my heart skip a beat
over Rui Hanazawa again?

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.270
It must be because I'm always 
carrying this around.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:49.250
"The Turning Of Love's Tide"

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.450
Tsukushi!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:56.120
Hi there!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.450
Oh...

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.020
What are you doing?

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.420
Nothing.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.230
Are you busy right now?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:07.900
Not at all.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:09.760
Then come with me!

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.600
W-wait a minute!

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:14.200
I'm going out to shop
for some clothes.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:19.970
I want to dress a little better...
when I go on dates with Tsukasa.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.750
You'll come with me, right?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.850
But, I...

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.560
You said you'd help me out, right?

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.680
How's this?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:02.890
Not bad!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:06.760
Really?
You think Tsukasa will like this?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.920
Well... I don't really know what he likes...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.590
Okay, I'll try some others on.
You tell me which to get.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:36.820
<i>Any guy would fall for her
if she told him she liked him.</i>

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:46.620
<i>Oh, that outfit's cute!</i>

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.000
<i>90,000 yen?!</i>

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.300
Hey, Tsukushi!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:17.390
I sure bought a lot.
It's really a great stress relief!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:22.460
<i>Buying such expensive clothes
is stress relief?</i>

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.060
<i>We really are different...</i>

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.180
Thanks so much
for helping me today, Tsukushi.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.100
It's nothing...

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.250
Is there anyone you like, Tsukushi?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.880
It's my turn to help you out.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.520
S-someone I like?

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.900
<i>Why is Rui Hanazawa's face...?</i>

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.590
So, there <i>is</i> someone!

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.290
N-no, of course not!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.770
He's just someone I can
sit and relax with.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.910
Have you told him how you feel?

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.610
No, really...
it's not like that!

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.560
Why not? Don't worry!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.100
If I were a guy,
I know I'd fall in love with you.

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.670
<i>She's not like
all the other rich girls.</i>

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.810
<i>She's honest and straightforward.</i>

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.750
<i>Maybe she's not so bad, after all...</i>

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.570
<i>Finally, I'm free...</i>

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:36.800
Here, Tsukushi.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.150
A thank you gift
for coming along with me.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.940
Why, this is...

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.130
I can't accept
something so expensive...

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.420
Don't worry about it.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:55.310
I'm sure it's going to
look great on you.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:06.890
See you!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.110
What should I do with this outfit?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.810
I'm always so indecisive...
always wavering.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:39.700
Domyoji!

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:41.990
Hold it!

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:46.000
What do you want?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.880
Why do you keep avoiding me?

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:52.260
What do you mean?!
You left me behind at that hotel...

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:53.890
and ran off with Shigeru!

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.850
I got you and that monkey girl
mixed up.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.570
That's hard to believe.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.920
I don't want to be involved
with you anymore.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.740
What are you saying?
You're the girl I love.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:19.950
I think Shigeru... someone like her...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.430
...is a better match for you.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:43.010
<i>It's no good...
We always end up like this.</i>

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:09.930
<i>I think God is telling me to give it up.</i>

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.450
I think it's up to us
to do something about this.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.470
She's not my type,
but I guess I've got to do it.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.630
What are you talking about?

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:33.620
I'm saying one of us has got to get
Okawahara Shigeru away from Tsukasa.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.130
Haven't you been paying attention?

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.920
You've got to help us, too, Rui.

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:44.730
With three of us guys,
one of us must surely be her type.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.030
No, thanks.

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.770
This is Tsukasa's family's business.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.670
If we get involved,
it'll just get more complicated.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:56.440
We're trying to make it complicated!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:10.620
Tsukasa...

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.940
What happened?
You're soaking wet.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:15.520
Didn't you catch a ride home?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.860
Wait here. I'll get you a towel.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.130
What happened? What's with that
expression on your face?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.590
Hey, Tsukasa...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.250
I did it again.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:34.130
<i>Maybe I really should end it.</i>

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.280
<i>The cut inside my mouth
is still there.</i>

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.750
<i>I wish it would hurry up and heal.</i>

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:56.220
<i>Whenever I feel it,
my heart hurts.</i>

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.050
Tsukushi, I need change.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.190
Oh...

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:06.630
Why are you so absent-minded, Tsukushi?
Are you all right?

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.730
Yeah... Sorry.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:15.070
<i>I think Shigeru... someone like her 
is a better match for you.</i>

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.910
<i>I should feel better after saying that,
but I don't.</i>

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:24.650
<i>I didn't even get mad
when he hit me.</i>

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.220
Shigeru?

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.320
Sorry, Yuki.
I'm stepping out for a bit...

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.490
Tsukushi!

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:37.360
Humph!

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:40.960
Shigeru!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.600
Tsukushi?

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.770
Hi!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:51.140
Nishikado? Mimasaka?
What are you three doing?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.240
We're having a date.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:58.780
A d-date? The three of you?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:04.040
They came by my school
to ask me out for some fun.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:04.820
Huh?!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:11.840
So we went out to Odaiba,
went by train to an amusement park,

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:18.730
...had tea four times, and walked here
from Aoyama while window shopping.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.870
Makino... Help me.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:26.410
She made me ride the roller coaster
five times with her!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.210
<i>This is great!</i>

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.380
But why you two?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.710
It seems they're trying to get me
to give Tsukasa up.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:38.610
What?

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:39.650
You knew?!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.090
You mustn't take me lightly.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.260
I knew exactly
what was on your minds.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:53.060
But neither of you are my type...

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:55.670
PRIDE

00:15:55.970 --> 00:16:00.940
Besides, you've got no stamina,
and good boys like you are rather boring...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:01.970
Come on!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.540
BORING

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.280
Tsukasa's the only one for me!

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.590
Thanks for spending time
with me, you two!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.460
Bye, Tsukushi!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.930
I'll call you later.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:30.770
Are you all right?

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:36.140
What's with her? Is she for real?

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:41.750
It's the first time I was ever happy to hear
a girl say I wasn't her type!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.920
<i>To think she could get the upper hand
 on these two playboys...</i>

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.190
Why did you do all that
for Domyoji?

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:56.030
It's because you're taking
your sweet time!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.480
Listen! I know we said
Tsukasa had a fianc馥.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:04.620
But you can break them up
if you want to.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.270
You could elope, or something.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.920
Tsukasa really loves you!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.160
Of course,
I know he's vicious and stupid...

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.510
The future won't be easy...

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:16.350
We can't sit by and do nothing!
Can't you do anything?

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:22.020
That rainy day... he came home soaking wet.
What happened?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.520
<i>I broke it off with Domyoji...</i>

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.260
<i>Broke it off?</i>

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.710
I told him Shigeru would be
a better match for him.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:37.690
How could you say that?
Think about how Tsukasa feels!

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:39.870
Well, what about you two?

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.670
Have you ever thought
about how I felt?

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:50.580
Here's this super-rich guy
with a scary mother...

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.420
And that mother offered me
50 million yen to give him up.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.850
Have you considered
how I felt being told that?

00:17:58.320 --> 00:17:59.720
50 million?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.120
Did you take it?

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.130
Of course not!

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:07.780
Why didn't you?

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.970
Your family will be paupers for life.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.300
I don't care about the money!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.740
I just can't stand that kind of attitude
from rich people.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:26.380
What have I done that's so wrong?
Why blame me?

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.980
Okay... I won't say anything more.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.890
Come on, don't cry...

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.530
I'm not crying.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:40.030
Of course...
It's asking too much of you.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:45.040
Maybe Tsukasa and Shigeru
could make a good pair, after all...

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.680
Makino, if you get lonely,
I'll play with you.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.210
As if! Not with you, Nishikado!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:17.300
<i>I won't have any regrets.
I'll put a stop to this vicious circle.</i>

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:36.750
Shigeru?

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:45.190
You startled me.
What are you doing here?

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:50.700
Tsukushi!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:57.700
You want to go shopping again?
The stores are all closed.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.680
Shigeru?

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:12.920
I...

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:18.320
Tsukasa asked me
to go out with him.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.160
I was so happy, I couldn't sit still!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.860
When I got home,
Tsukasa was standing there.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:41.640
<i>Monkey... I mean... Shigeru...</i>

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:47.250
<i>Shigeru... please go out with me.</i>

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.500
He said he'd try to learn to love me.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:11.110
I'm so... so happy, I can't stop crying!

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:17.450
I didn't realize
how much I'd come to love Domyoji.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.390
What should I do, Tsukushi?

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:32.190
<i>I won't have any... regrets.</i>

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.270
Congratulations.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:04.680
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:09.430
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:18.900
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:24.710
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:32.460
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:38.080
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:44.700
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:51.100
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:58.000
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:06.880
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:14.790
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.790 --> 00:23:20.850
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:28.110
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:31.500
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:37.370
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:52.900
Shigeru, her shoulders shaking, crying
her eyes out... I'm happy for her... I think.

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:56.170
Now, I'm finally free of Domyoji.

00:23:57.370 --> 00:24:02.170
The instant I congratulated him,
something ended.

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:06.140
Hana Yori Dango:
"The Dawning of a New Day"

00:24:06.740 --> 00:24:08.680
This is how it should be, right?
